OL,3,GNEWSACouncillor quits group over junior
OL,4,Aschool move
OL,5,
OL,6,FA councillor has quit the majority
OL,7,Fgroup on a council in protest over
OL,8,Fplans to relocate a junior school.
OL,10,FMark Johnston resigned from the Liberal
OL,11,FDemocrat group on East Surrey Council
OL,12,F(ESC) after its cabinet approved the
OL,13,Fmove of Reigate Priory Junior School to
OL,14,FWoodhatch Place.
OL,16,FThe decision was taken last month after
OL,17,Fa debate in which cabinet members
OL,18,Fraised concerns about the impact on
OL,19,Ftraffic and the future of the school's
OL,20,Fcurrent Grade I listed site.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,327,320,200,140,0,100
