OL,3,GNEWSACouncillor quits group over junior
OL,4,Aschool move
OL,5,
OL,6,FJohnston, who represents Reigate,
OL,7,Fremains a Liberal Democrat member and
OL,8,Fwill continue to sit on ESC as well as
OL,9,Fserving on Reigate & Banstead Borough
OL,10,FCouncil.
